my $CODE = <<'END_CODE';
foo bar baz
END_CODE

{
    desc => q{n with no previous search shows error},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
## Macro: `xt/visual/macros/search_n_no_previous`

Pressing **n** when no search has been performed yet shows an error message.

**Keys:** `n`

**initial.png**
- Cursor at line 1, col 0
- Normal mode, no prior search

**after_n_no_prev.png**
- Error message displayed (e.g., "Error: No previous search pattern")
- Cursor still at line 1, col 0
- Buffer unchanged
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('n');
        $ctx->delay(200);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_n_no_prev');
    },
}
